## Why Static Apparel Photos Suffer from High Return Rates

Online apparel shoppers constantly worry about two things: fit and fabric quality. Static photos fail to convey drape, stretch, thickness, and movement.

By generating dynamic AI try-on sequences:
- Showcase 360-degree spins highlighting seams, waistlines, and hem movement.
- Provide "3 Ways to Style" inspiration: office professional, casual weekend, and evening dinner.
- Reduce return rates by up to 22% by setting accurate visual expectations before checkout.
